{"level":30,"time":1776978871027,"pid":122,"hostname":"0067a724-a36","step":"review-runs","item":"13.md","index":8,"runIndex":"run-3","type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-haiku-4-5-20251001","id":"msg_01LWVPiEDkz5JdEk38GUjzP7","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01QoyEthQAqFRamF5WKeCt3A","name":"mcp__conductor_tools__vision","input":{"documentId":"1144b126-1216-4dee-a89c-178950fa7777","sheetNum":21,"prompt":"Examine the Preliminary Electrical Design Plan (Sheet 21) and provide detailed information about:\n\n1. **Transformer Pad Locations:** Identify and describe the exact location of each transformer pad shown on the plan (note building proximity, coordinates if available, or relative position). Note how many transformer pads are shown.\n\n2. **Transformer Pad Details:** For each transformer pad, identify:\n   - Dimensions (if shown)\n   - Equipment specifications (service type: single-phase or three-phase; oil-filled or dry-type)\n   - Access door orientation if visible\n   - Any dimension lines or distance callouts showing clearances to buildings, structures, or other features\n\n3. **Clearances Shown:** List any clearances explicitly dimensioned on the plan:\n   - Horizontal clearances from buildings, structures, parking areas, etc.\n   - Vertical clearances or niche configurations\n   - Separation from utilities (water, wastewater, storm drain, gas lines)\n   - Clearances from landscaping, fences, or other site features\n\n4. **Property Location:** Confirm whether transformer pad(s) are located entirely on private property or if they are close to property lines or easements. Note any easement boundaries shown.\n\n5. **Underground Utilities:** Identify the routing of underground electric lines to/from the transformer pads and any interactions with other utilities (water, wastewater, storm drain).\n\n6. **Parking and Circulation:** Note the proximity of transformer pad(s) to parking areas, vehicle circulation routes, or drive aisles. Identify if bollards are shown in the detail sheets or electrical plan.\n\n7. **Cross-References:** Note any references to detail sheets, electrical specifications, or Austin Energy Design approvals on the electrical plan sheet."},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":11,"cache_creation_input_tokens":2680,"cache_read_input_tokens":42054,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":2680,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"output_tokens":2,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"0ccf6950-9428-47a1-a0e1-f1b6954e2e70","uuid":"82455367-86a8-4343-8a85-06e7b746d55f"}
