nce callouts, or specific textual notes visible on this plan sheet that indicate horizontal or vertical clearances between the proposed trees and the overhead electric (\"OHE\") lines.\n\n**5. Overall Distribution of Trees:**\nThe overall distribution of trees is highly **perimeter-focused**. The landscaping strategy appears primarily dedicated to buffering and screening the edges of the property:\n*   Dense rows of trees outline the north, east, and south property boundaries.\n*   The west section features significant street yard landscaping along the public right-of-way.\n*   The interior distribution is sparse by comparison, limited to a few specific parking lot landscape islands situated between the buildings and parking areas.","providerMetadata":{"google":{"thoughtSignature":""}}}],"finishReason":"stop","usage":{"inputTokens":1476,"outputTokens":617,"totalTokens":4029,"reasoningTokens":1936},"warnings":[],"providerMetadata":{"google":{"promptFeedback":null,"groundingMetadata":null,"urlContextMetadata":null,"safetyRatings":null,"serviceTier":null},"gateway":{"routing":{"originalModelId":"google/gemini-3.1-pro-preview","resolvedProvider":"vertex","resolvedProviderApiModelId":"gemini-3.1-pro-preview","fallbacksAvailable":["google"],"planningReasoning":"System credentials planned for: vertex, google. Total execution order: vertex(system) → google(system)","canonicalSlug":"google/gemini-3.1-pro-preview","finalProvider":"vertex","modelAttemptCount":1,"modelAttempts":[{"modelId":"vertex:gemini-3.1-pro-preview","canonicalSlug":"google/gemini-3.1-pro-preview","success":true,"providerAttemptCount":1,"providerAttempts":[{"provider":"vertex","internalModelId":"vertex:gemini-3.1-pro-preview","providerApiModelId":"gemini-3.1-pro-preview","credentialType":"system","success":true,"startTime":2904934.779866,"endTime":2929826.678705,"statusCode":200,"providerResponseId":"xovqabLlFJ6Sl7oP3qDp4A4"}]}],"totalProviderAttemptCount":1},"cost":"0.033588","marketCost":"0.033588","infer