{"level":30,"time":1776978928700,"pid":122,"hostname":"0067a724-a36","step":"review-runs","item":"1.md","index":9,"runIndex":"run-3","documentId":"1144b126-1216-4dee-a89c-178950fa7777","sheetNum":4,"prompt":"Please examine Sheet 4 (Existing Conditions Survey) and identify all overhead electric utility infrastructure visible on the site. Specifically note:\n\n1. Location and number of existing utility poles on or adjacent to the property\n2. Routing of any overhead utility lines (labeled as O.H.U.L. or similar)\n3. Location of electric easements marked on the survey\n4. Location of any transformers on pads\n5. Proximity of overhead infrastructure to property boundaries and adjacent improvements\n\nProvide spatial descriptions (e.g., northeast corner, along Valley View Road frontage, etc.) and any visible clearance relationships between existing overhead lines and the site's boundaries or improvements.","res":{"steps":[{"content":[{"type":"text","text":"Based on a visual analysis of Sheet 4, \"Existing Conditions Survey,\" here is the identification of overhead electric utility infrastructure visible on the site:\n\n**1. Location and number of existing utility poles:**\nThere are several utility poles marked on the survey with a specific circle symbol, with at least one explicitly labeled as \"UTILITY POLE\".\n*   **Western Frontage (Valley View Road):** There is one explicitly labeled \"UTILITY POLE\" located near the northwest curve of the property line along Valley View Road. Another pole symbol is visible further south along this frontage, near the southwest corner of the property.\n*   **Southern Boundary:** There are approximately three utility pole symbols located along the southern property boundary (labeled `S63°00'28\"E 419.86'`). One is situated near the southwest corner, one is roughly midway along the boundary (near a tree tagged 4620), and another is located near the southeast property corner.\n\n**2. Routing of overhead utility lines (O.H.U.L.):**\nThe 