{"level":30,"time":1776978939538,"pid":122,"hostname":"0067a724-a36","step":"review-runs","item":"1.md","index":9,"runIndex":"run-3","type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-haiku-4-5-20251001","id":"msg_01EBKUdwy8cmuzFz6dRtKnE8","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01E4stCun1H5E2tkPMj3wU3Z","name":"mcp__conductor_tools__vision","input":{"documentId":"1144b126-1216-4dee-a89c-178950fa7777","sheetNum":9,"prompt":"Please examine Sheet 9 (Proposed Site Plan) and describe the relationship between the proposed buildings (Buildings 1-8) and any overhead electric infrastructure visible on the plan. Specifically note:\n\n1. The location and routing of any overhead utility lines shown on this proposed site plan\n2. Proximity of proposed buildings to overhead lines (identify which building(s) are near overhead infrastructure)\n3. Proximity of proposed driveways, parking areas, and sidewalks to overhead lines\n4. Any clearance dimensions or annotations shown between proposed structures and overhead utilities\n5. Whether any buildings or site features appear to be positioned directly beneath or in conflict with overhead lines from the existing survey\n\nPlease provide spatial descriptions using building numbers and site areas (e.g., \"Building 1 is located northwest..., the overhead line runs...\").\n"},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":12,"cache_creation_input_tokens":3146,"cache_read_input_tokens":47620,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":3146,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"output_tokens":1,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"11ce902f-86c5-4003-b16c-9143da511761","uuid":"eb7e52f9-a842-4aa1-bd7e-9333a2cb3f9a"}
{"level":30,"time":1776978939602,"pid":122,"hostname":"0067a724-a36","step":"review-runs","item":"1.md","index":9,"runIndex":"run-3","documentId":"1144b126-1216-4dee-a89c-178950fa7777","sheetNum":9,"prompt":"Please examine Sheet 9 (Proposed Site Plan) and describe the relationship between the proposed buildings (Buildings 1-8) and any overhead electric infrastructure visible on the plan. Specifically note:\n\n1. The location and routing of any overhead utility lines shown on this proposed site plan\n2. Proximity of proposed buildings to overhead lines (identify which building(s) are near overhead infrastructure)\n3. Proximity of proposed driveways, parking areas, and sidewalks to overhead lines\n4. Any clearance dimensions or annotations shown between proposed structures and overhead utilities\n5. Whether any buildings or site features appear to be positioned directly beneath or in conflict with overhead lines from the existing survey\n\nPlease provide spatial descriptions using building numbers and site areas (e.g., \"Building 1 is located northwest..., the overhead line runs...\").\n","msg":"Calling vision tool: 1144b126-1216-4dee-a89c-178950fa7777 (9)"}
{"level":30,"time":1776978939794,"pid":122,"hostname":"0067a724-a36","step":"review-runs","item":"13.md","index":5,"runIndex":"run-2","type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-haiku-4-5-20251001","id":"msg_01U8zWtfZobAXeAPpVjyAYPN","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Now I have a good understanding of the site layout and key infrastructure. Let me now look at the specific details I need to evaluate. I need to:\n\n1. Measure distances from transformer pads to buildings\n2. Check if transformers have adequate clearances\n3. Check if trees near transformers are utility-compatible species\n4. Check if transformer pads are on private property\n5. Check if transformer pads are in easements\n6. Check parking proximity\n7. Check drainage direction (for oil-filled equipment)\n8. Check if cross-section drawings exist\n9. Check if transformer pad dimensions match AE Design specs\n10. Check if bollards are shown/required\n\nFrom the vision analysis of Sheet 21, I know:\n- Pad 1 (West): 30-40 feet from Buildings 1-2, has trees nearby, near PUE easements, close to parking, near overhead electric line\n- Pad 2 (North Central): 5-10 feet from Buildings 4-5, adjacent to parking, near sidewalk\n- Pad 3 (South Central): 5-10 feet from Buildings 6-7, adjacent to parking, near sidewalk\n\nKey missing items:\n1. No transformer pad dimensions shown\n2. No access door orientations shown\n3. No hot-stick clearance diagrams\n4. No AE Design detail references\n5. No bollard specifications or callouts\n6. No cross-section drawings\n\nLet me now use the measure-distance tool to actually measure the clearances from the transformer pads to various features. I'll start by measuring distances to buildings, then to parking, trees, and other features.","signature":""}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":11,"cache_creation_input_tokens":2887,"cache_read_input_tokens":57473,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_inp