ide boundaries.\n\n***\n\n### Data Table Transcriptions\nAs requested by your strict transcription instructions, here are exact character-by-character reproductions of the key data tables relevant to the buildings and parking layout:\n\n**Building Data Table**\n| Building # | Building Type | Gross Floor Area (sf) | Building Coverage (sf) |\n| :--- | :--- | :--- | :--- |\n| 1 | 4 Plex | 8,350 | 3,290 |\n| 2 | 6 Plex | 13,004 | 4,997 |\n| 3 | 5 Plex | 10,776 | 4,144 |\n| 4 | 5 Plex | 10,776 | 4,144 |\n| 5 | 4 Plex | 8,350 | 3,290 |\n| 6 | 4 Plex | 8,350 | 3,290 |\n| 7 | 5 Plex | 10,776 | 4,144 |\n| 8 | 6 Plex | 13,004 | 4,997 |\n\n**Parking Data**\n*   **Land Use:** Residential\n*   **Parking Spaces Provided:** 70 Surface / 76 Garage\n*   **Compact Spaces Provided:** 0\n*   **ADA Spaces Required:** 3\n*   **ADA Spaces Provided:** 3\n*   **Total Bicycle Spaces Required:** 5\n*   **Long Term Bicycle Spaces Required:** 3\n*   **Long Term Bicycle Spaces Provided:** 39 (1 per Garage)\n*   **Short Term Bicycle Spaces Required:** 2\n*   **Short Term Bicycle Spaces Provided:** 2"}]}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"a8920d43-e944-47ba-ad17-2e6340f56c7c","uuid":"f32f238c-0311-4011-8287-bb4a37f8b333","tool_use_result":[{"type":"text","text":"Based on the provided site plan document for the \"Valley View Townhomes,\" here is the detailed layout analysis and specific requested information.\n\n### Site Plan Layout Relative to Valley View Road\n\nThe primary street frontage, **Valley View Road**, is located along the **left (western)** boundary of the site plan. This is indicated by the property's main right-of-way (R.O.W.), the primary public sidewalk, and the main driveway entrances connecting into the site from the left edge. \n\n**Location of the 8 Buildings:**\nThe 8 buildings are arranged internally around a central looped driveway system, moving from west (Valley View Road) to east (rear of the property):\n*   **Bldg. 1 (4 plex):** Located in the top-left corner, set