{"level":30,"time":1776979988772,"pid":122,"hostname":"0067a724-a36","step":"review-runs","item":"13.md","index":8,"runIndex":"run-3","type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-haiku-4-5-20251001","id":"msg_01R1tLJVPUMMod4YvK7MXzAS","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01DJxjSjDShb3QFJPPhfeXzS","name":"mcp__conductor_tools__vision","input":{"documentId":"1144b126-1216-4dee-a89c-178950fa7777","sheetNum":9,"prompt":"Examine Sheet 9 (Site Plan) and identify the locations of the following features that will be used for measuring clearances from transformer pads:\n\n1. **Buildings** - Identify the footprints and walls of Buildings 1-8 with their relative positions\n2. **Parking Areas** - Identify all parking spaces, parking aisles, and drive-through areas\n3. **Fire Hydrants** - Identify the location of the private fire hydrant on the site\n4. **Dumpsters** - Identify trash/dumpster enclosure locations\n5. **Retaining Walls** - Identify retaining wall locations\n6. **Sidewalks** - Identify sidewalk locations and back-of-sidewalk edges\n7. **Fences** - Identify fence locations and types\n8. **Bicycle Racks** - Identify bicycle parking locations\n9. **Light Poles** - Identify any light pole locations shown\n10. **Fire Lanes** - Identify fire lane designations and striping\n11. **Property Lines** - Identify property boundary lines\n12. **Easements** - Identify easement boundaries shown on the plan\n\nFor each feature, provide specific location information (e.g., \"Fire hydrant in northeast corner near Building X\", \"Dumpster enclosure south of Building X\") that can be used to calculate distances from the transformer pad locations on the electrical plan."},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":10,"cache_creation_input_tokens":6784,"cache_read_input_tokens":66044,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":6784,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"output_token