{"level":30,"time":1776979988788,"pid":122,"hostname":"0067a724-a36","step":"review-runs","item":"2.md","index":7,"runIndex":"run-3","documentId":"1144b126-1216-4dee-a89c-178950fa7777","sheetNum":31,"prompt":"Focus specifically on the southern boundary where the \"- OHE -\" overhead electric line is located. Identify each tree symbol that overlaps or is positioned within approximately 20-30 feet of the OHE line. For each tree, note: 1) Its symbol type (circle with dots, circles with hash marks, circles with crosses, or other designation); 2) Its letter designation if visible (M, SY, PL, or other); 3) Its approximate distance from the OHE line; 4) Any nearby label or note that identifies the species. From the Key Notes, SY = Street Yard Tree, PL = Parking Lot Tree, M = Mitigation Tree. Report all trees visible near the OHE line from west to east along the southern boundary.","res":{"steps":[{"content":[{"type":"text","text":"Based on the provided landscape plan, here is the visual analysis of the tree symbols located along the southern boundary near the \"- OHE -\" (overhead electric) line, scanning from west (left) to east (right).\n\n**General Observations for this Area:**\n*   Based on the provided definitions from the Key Notes, the only letter designation found on trees near the southern OHE line is **\"M\"** (Mitigation Tree). No trees in this specific stretch are designated as \"SY\" or \"PL\".\n*   There are no explicit text labels or callouts identifying specific plant species (e.g., \"Live Oak\") for any of the trees along this southern OHE boundary. \n\n**Tree Inventory (West to East along the Southern OHE line):**\n\n**1. Far West (Southwest Corner Area)**\n*   **Symbol Type:** Large circular outline indicating a canopy, with a smaller central circle containing a simple cross (+).\n*   **Letter Designation:** None visible.\n*   **Approximate Distance:** The large canopy circle directly overlaps the \"- OHE -\" line.\n*   **Species Label/Note:** None.\n\n*(Moving east, there is a long gap with no trees until approaching the southeast section of the property.)*\n\n**2. Southeast Section (First of a cluster of three)**\n*   **Symbol Type:** Circle containing an internal squiggly/branching line pattern.\n*   **Letter Designation:** **\"M\"** is located immediately to the right of the symbol.\n*   **Approximate Distance:** The symbol is situated directly on/overlapping the \"- OHE -\" line.\n*   **Species Label/Note:** None.\n\n**3. Southeast Section (Second of a cluster of three)**\n*   **Symbol Type:** Circle containing an internal squiggly/branching line pattern.\n*   **Letter Designation:** **\"M\"** is located immediately right/below the symbol.\n*   **Approximate Distance:** Located slightly north of the \"- OHE -\" line. Based on the 1\"=20' scale, it appears to be approximately 10-15 feet away.\n*   **Species Label/Note:** None.\n\n**4. Southeast Section (Third of a cluster of three)**\n*   **Symbol Type:** Circle containing a simple cross (+).\n*   **Letter Designation:** **\"M\"** is located immediately right/below the symbol.\n*   **Approximate Distance:** Located slightly north of the \"- OHE -\" line. Based on scale, it appears to be approximately 15-20 feet away.\n*   **Species Label/Note:** None.\n\n**5. Far East (Southeast Corner Area)**\n*   **Symbol Type:** Large dashed circular outline indicating a canopy, with a smaller solid inner circle containing a simple cross (+).\n*   **Letter Designation:** **\"M\"** is located inside the smaller inner circle.\n*   **Approximate Distance:** The dashed outer canopy circle overlaps the \"- OHE -\" line. The inner trunk symbol is located just north of the line, approximately 5-10 feet away.\n*   **Species Label/Note:** None.","providerMetadata":{"google":{"thoughtSignature":""}}}],"finishReason":"stop","usage":{"inputTokens":1466,"outputTokens":662,"totalTokens":5211,"reasoningTokens":3083},"warnings":[],"request":{"body":{"prompt":[{"role":"user","content":[{"typ