ctric Easement\"`). \n\n**Summary Note on Clarity and Dimensions:**\nThe easement boundaries present on the plan (Drainage, Electric, P.U.E.) are clearly drawn with distinct dashed lines and are explicitly dimensioned in their text labels (e.g., 5', 10', 25'). There is no indication of high-voltage transmission facilities; only standard distribution elements (\"OHE\" and \"Power Pole\") are mapped."}]}
