Overhead electric lines are shown in plan view on Sheets 4, 9, and 21, but no elevation data or vertical clearance dimensions are provided to demonstrate compliance with clearance requirements."},{"deficiencyId":"EL-1.8","status":"not-verifiable","codeCitations":["UCM § 1.10.3"],"applicableAreas":["Buildings 1, 2, 8; potential building projections; western and southern boundaries"],"sheetReferences":[{"documentId":"1144b126-1216-4dee-a89c-178950fa7777","sheetNumber":9},{"documentId":"1144b126-1216-4dee-a89c-178950fa7777","sheetNumber":21}],"documentReferences":[],"comment":"Site plan and electrical design plan show building footprints and overhead utility lines in plan view only. No section or elevation views with dimension lines from outer electric conductor to outermost edges of buildings and building projections are provided. Cannot verify clearances from conductor to building faces without these section exhibits."},{"deficiencyId":"EL-1.18","status":"not-verifiable","codeCitations":["UCM § 1.10.6.2"],"applicableAreas":["Driveway access points from Valley View Road (western entrance)"],"sheetReferences":[{"documentId":"1144b126-1216-4dee-a89c-178950fa7777","sheetNumber":4},{"documentId":"1144b126-1216-4dee-a89c-178950fa7777","sheetNumber":9},{"documentId":"1144b126-1216-4dee-a89c-178950fa7777","sheetNumber":11}],"documentReferences":[],"comment":"Driveways from Valley View Road pass directly beneath overhead electric lines shown on existing conditions survey and site plan. Grading plan shows finished driveway grades but no section views or profile exhibits document vertical clearances from driveway surface to the lowest point of overhead electric conductors. No mid-span clearance survey data from a registered surveyor is provided. Minimum 16-foot vertical clearance (or 18 feet with truck traffic) cannot be verified without mid-span clearance documentation."},{"deficiencyId":"EL-1.23","status":"fail","codeCitations":["UCM § 1.10.3"],"applicableAreas":["Entire site