144b126-1216-4dee-a89c-178950fa7777","sheetNumber":4}],"documentReferences":[],"comment":"Site plan shows proposed buildings with some having locations near existing overhead electric facilities along the southern boundary. No building elevation sheets with surveyed conductor locations or section views demonstrating both 7.5-foot sky-to-ground and 15-foot radial clearances from building projections (overhangs, awnings, balconies, decks, roofs, patios) are provided for verification."},{"deficiencyId":"EL-1.6","status":"not-verifiable","codeCitations":["UCM § 1.10.3"],"applicableAreas":["All buildings near property boundaries with overhead electric facilities"],"sheetReferences":[{"documentId":"1144b126-1216-4dee-a89c-178950fa7777","sheetNumber":9},{"documentId":"1144b126-1216-4dee-a89c-178950fa7777","sheetNumber":4}],"documentReferences":[],"comment":"Existing overhead electric facilities are located within electric easements adjacent to the site boundary along Valley View Road and the southern property line. Site plan does not provide dimension annotations or clearance verification exhibits demonstrating that buildings maintain minimum 7.5-foot horizontal sky-to-ground and 15-foot radial clearance from these existing overhead facilities."},{"deficiencyId":"EL-1.7","status":"not-verifiable","codeCitations":["UCM § 1.10.3"],"applicableAreas":["All buildings (Buildings 1-8) potentially within clearance distance of overhead electric facilities"],"sheetReferences":[{"documentId":"1144b126-1216-4dee-a89c-178950fa7777","sheetNumber":9},{"documentId":"1144b126-1216-4dee-a89c-178950fa7777","sheetNumber":4}],"documentReferences":[],"comment":"No building elevation sheets are provided that include surveyed conductor elevations or clearance dimension annotations. Without surveyed conductor location data and building elevation exhibits with dimension lines originating from the outside conductor location, vertical clearances cannot be verified."},{"deficiencyId":"EL-1.8","status":"not-verifiable","codeCitations":["UCM § 1.10.3"],"applicableAreas":["Buildings 6 and 8 and proposed structures near southern overhead line"],"sheetReferences":[{"documentId":"1144b126-1216-4dee-a89c-178950fa7777","sheetNumber":9},{"documentId":"1144b126-1216-4dee-a89c-178950fa7777","sheetNumber":4}],"documentReferences":[],"comment":"Section views and enlarged plan details showing dimensions from the outer electric conductor to the outermost edge of buildings and building projections are not provided on the submitted site plan. Clearance verification from the outside conductor location cannot be performed."},{"deficiencyId":"EL-1.14","status":"fail","codeCitations":["UCM § 1.10.3"],"applicableAreas":["Southern property boundary where concrete retaining wall is proposed"],"sheetReferences":[{"documentId":"1144b126-1216-4dee-a89c-178950fa7777","sheetNumber":9},{"documentId":"1144b126-1216-4dee-a89c-178950fa7777","sheetNumber":38},{"documentId":"1144b126-1216-4dee-a89c-178950fa7777","sheetNumber":4}],"documentReferences":[],"comment":"Proposed concrete retaining wall runs along the southern property line in the same location as the existing overhead electric line shown on the existing conditions survey. Section views and clearance dimension annotations from the outside electric line conductor to the wall face are not provided on the retaining wall detail sheets (Sheets 38-39). No evidence of minimum 7.5-foot horizontal sky-to-ground clearance verification."},{"deficiencyId":"EL-1.17","status":"fail","codeCitations":["UCM § 1.10.3"],"applicableAreas":["Proposed concrete retaining wall along southern property boundary"],"sheetReferences":[{"documentId":"1144b126-1216-4dee-a89c-178950fa7777","sheetNumber":38},{"documentId":"1144b126-1216-4dee-a89c-178950fa7777","sheetNumber":39}],"documentReferences":[],"comment":"Retaining wall detail sheets (Sheets 38-39) show cross-sections and structural details but lack dimension annotations showing clearance from the outside electric conductor to the outermost edge (face) of the proposed wall. Cross-sectional exhibits do not include surveyed conductor elevation or clearance verification dimensions."},{"deficiencyId":"EL-1.23","status":"not-verifiable","codeCitations":["UCM § 1.10.3"],"applicableAreas":["Site plan annotations where clearances are shown"],"sheetReferences":[{"documentId":"1144b126-1216-4dee-a89c-178950fa7777","sheetNumber":9},{"documentId":"1144b126-1216-4dee-a89c-178950fa7777","sheetNumber":21}],"documentReferences":[],"comment":"No clearance dimensions are shown on the site plan between proposed structures and the existing overhead electric facilities. Cannot verify whether any dimension annotations that may exist on other details originate from the outside conductor rather than the utility pole centerline."},{"deficiencyId":"EL-1.31","status":"not-verifiable","codeCitations":["UCM § 1.10.3"],"applicableAreas":["Proposed retaining wall and site features near southern overhead electric line"],"sheetReferences":[{"documentId":"1144b126-1216-4dee-a89c-178950fa7777","sheetNumber":9},{"documentId":"1144b126-1216-4dee-a89c-178950fa7777","sheetNumber":38},{"documentId":"1144b126-1216-4dee-a89c-178950fa7777","sheetNumber":11}],"documentReferences":[],"comment":"Vertical clearance from the existing overhead electric facilities to the proposed retaining wall and grading along the southern property line appears marginal or insufficient based on available site plan data. No registered surveyor mid-span clearance data showing measured clearances at mid-span of the overhead line above the finished grade and structures has been provided for verification."},{"deficiencyId":"EL-1.37","status":"not-verifiable","codeCitations":["ECM § 2.4.1.D","ECM § 2.4.2.C","UCM § 1.10.10.4"],"applicableAreas":["Southern property boundary near overhead electric line where mitigation trees are proposed"],"sheetReferences":[{"documentId":"1144b126-1216-4dee-a89c-178950fa7777","sheetNumber":31},{"documentId":"1144b126-1216-4dee-a89c-178950fa7777","sheetNumber":32}],"documentReferences":[],"comment":"Landscape plan (Sheet 31) shows tree plantings with canopies overlapping the overhead electric line along the southern boundary, but no species identifications are provided on the landscape plan itself. Tree list (Sheet 32) shows various species with Appendix F designations, but spatial mapping of which specific trees are planted near the overhead line is not clear from the documents. Cannot verify whether trees within 10 lateral feet of distribution conductors are from the Utility Compatible species list in ECM Appendix F or within 50 lateral feet of transmission conductors."},{"deficiencyId":"EL-1.46","status":"not-verifiable","codeCitations":["UCM § 1.10.2"],"applicableAreas":["Entire site with overhead electric lines"],"sheetReferences":[{"documentId":"1144b126-1216-4dee-a89c-178950fa7777","sheetNumber":3},{"documentId":"1144b126-1216-4dee-a89c-178950fa7777","sheetNumber":9}],"documentReferences":[],"comment":"Cover sheet and general notes sheets (Sheets 1-3) do not include a note requiring that the owner/contractor notify Austin Energy at least 48 hours before work begins near high-voltage overhead lines as required by Texas Health & Safety Code Chapter 752, Section 752.003. This requirement must be added to site plans whenever overhead electric lines exist on or adjacent to the site."}]},"fast_mode_state":"off","uuid":"daadb19b-99c9-424d-b52b-f1f257284270"}
{"level":30,"time":1776980659769,"pid":122,"hostname":"0067a724-a36","step":"review-runs","item":"13.md","index":5,"runIndex":"run-2","type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-haiku-4-5-20251001","id":"msg_01Wh3xr8cG28FhrURrF4FqRh","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01Tf3PFCwNa86VHvhwC589fn","name":"mcp__conductor_tools__vision","input":{"documentId":"1144b126-1216-4dee-a89c-178950fa7777","sheetNum":21,"prompt":"Please examine the entire Preliminary Electrical Design Plan (Sheet 21) and answer the following questions:\n\n1. **Transformer Easements**: Are transformer easements shown around any of the three transformer pads? Easements are typically shown as dashed lines or labeled rectangular areas indicating the width of the easement (e.g., \"Electrical Easement,\" \"Transformer Easement,\" with dimensions). If shown, what width is indicated and for which pads?\n\n2. **Property Boundaries and Right-of-Way**: Are property lines clearly drawn on this plan? Do any transformer pads appear to straddle property lines or extend into public right-of-way areas?\n\n3. **Easement Labels**: What easements are labeled on the plan? Are there drainage easements, utility easements, or electrical easements shown that might restrict transformer placement? List all easement labels visible.\n\n4. **Transformer Pad Specifications/Details Reference**: Are there any callouts, detail references (e.g., \"See Detail 8.1\", \"Per Sheet 22\"), or notes specifically referencing Austin Energy Design transformer pad detail sheets? Or any dimensions showing pad sizes?\n\n5. **Underground Line Routing and Separations**: For each transformer pad, describe the routing of underground electric lines connecting to the pad. Do you see any other underground utilities (storm drain, water, wastewater) shown in proximity to the transformer pads? What appears to be the minimum separation visible?\n\n6. **Access Door Orientation and Hot-Stick Clearance Area**: Is there any indication of which side of the transformer pad is the access door? Are there any dashed lines, arcs, or notation showing the required hot-stick clearance area (typically shown as a clear zone in front of the access door)?\n\nPlease provide specific observations from the plan drawing."},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":12,"cache_creation_input_tokens":46200,"cache_read_input_tokens":19314,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":46200,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"output_tokens":1,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"2f2d0cbc-d0ea-481e-8f7b-51f5d8083c45","uuid":"0ca6b53f-92de-4218-b52d-5cc67ec4546f"}
