gs so far:\n1. Trees with trunk centers within 15 feet of OHE line are violations of EL-2.1 unless they're utility-compatible\n\n\n2. Any tree reaching 40+ feet mature height within 25 feet of the OHE line violates EL-2.3\n3. The plant schedule only lists quantities and species, not placement locations on the site\n4. Installation heights are documented, but mature heights per ECM Appendix F are missing\n5. No utility-compatibility designations (UC status) are provided for any species\n6. I should check Sheet 30 for an existing tree inventory that might contain mature height information","signature":""}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":6,"cache_creation_input_tokens":60129,"cache_read_input_tokens":0,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":60129,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"output_tokens":1,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"b4bf1903-670d-4b71-b534-95d04a5dca76","uuid":"ae527340-b014-4a8c-8a1e-986be3cfb69f"}
