lity separations are not dimensioned on the electrical plan. While utilities are shown crossing, no minimum separations are verified per UCM § 1.10.5.A.\n\n\nI need to cross-check Sheet 32 to confirm whether the trees are identified by species and whether those species meet ECM Appendix F compatibility requirements. I should also look for any cross-section details that show clearances from overhead lines or structures, which would address EL-13.31.","signature":""}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":10,"cache_creation_input_tokens":963,"cache_read_input_tokens":69751,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":963,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"output_tokens":1,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"2f2d0cbc-d0ea-481e-8f7b-51f5d8083c45","uuid":"59b4fcad-fbaf-4845-b22f-9c4fe2870df8"}
