{"level":30,"time":1776981768004,"pid":122,"hostname":"0067a724-a36","step":"review-runs","item":"1.md","index":3,"runIndex":"run-1","type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-haiku-4-5-20251001","id":"msg_01NVxz4rQBr5SSK1eyoZN91L","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Based on my comprehensive review of the site plan for Valley View Townhomes, I have completed the electrical clearances evaluation for grouping EL-1. Here's a summary of my findings:\n\n## RESEARCH SUMMARY\n\n### Existing Conditions Identified:\n- **Overhead utility lines (O.H.U.L.)** run along Valley View Road (western boundary) with multiple utility poles and guy wires\n- **Additional overhead lines** run along the northern property boundary (adjacent to Lot A, Cortez Heights)\n- **Utility poles** are marked on the existing conditions survey (Sheet 4) with guy wires attached\n- **Two main driveway entrances** from Valley View Road pass directly beneath/adjacent to these overhead lines\n- **5-foot concrete sidewalk** proposed along Valley View Road in the same corridor as overhead utility lines\n- **Transformers** (3 proposed) shown on electrical design plan\n- **Mitigation trees** (Cedar Elm and Live Oak) proposed along southern boundary, appearing to be within 10-15 feet of overhead electric line\n\n### Missing or Incomplete Documentation:\n- **No building elevation sheets** showing surveyed overhead conductor elevations or vertical clearances\n- **No profile sections or vertical dimension drawings** showing driveway grades relative to overhead conductors\n- **No surveyor data** for conductor locations, mid-span clearances, or vertical clearances\n- **No clearance dimensions** on site plan showing distances from outside conductor to buildings, driveways, or utilities\n- **Trees not verified** as utility-compatible species or dimensioned for proper clearance distances\n- **No 48-hour notification requirement** noted on cover sheet or general notes\n- **Down guy wire locations** not clearly shown with conflict analysis relative to proposed sidewalk\n\n### Findings Submitted:\nI have flagged **8 deficiencies** (3 fail + 5 not-verifiable):\n\n**FAIL Items:**\n1. **EL-1.23** - Clearance dimensions measured from pole instead of outside conductor; no dimensions at all shown\n2. **EL-1.46** - Required 48-hour notification to Austin Energy note missing from plans\n\n**NOT-VERIFIABLE Items:**\n3. **EL-1.1** - Building clearances cannot be verified without elevation sheets\n4. **EL-1.7** - Surveyed conductor elevations not provided\n5. **EL-1.8** - No section views with building clearance dimensions\n6. **EL-1.18** - Driveway vertical clearances not documented; no mid-span clearance survey data\n7. **EL-1.31** - No registered surveyor data for pole locations and mid-span clearances  \n8. **EL-1.37** - Trees near overhead lines without utility-compatibility verification or clearance dimensions\n\n## CRITICAL ITEMS REQUIRING ACTION\n\nThe applicant must:\n1. **Provide building elevation sheets** with surveyed overhead conductor elevations and dimensioned clearances\n2. **Provide registered surveyor data** documenting conductor locations and mid-span clearances on driveways\n3. **Add clearance dimensions** to site plan showing distances measured from outside conductor (not pole center) to all buildings, driveways, and utilities\n4. **Verify tree species** as ECM Appendix F utility-compatible (UC) and dimension clearances to overhead lines\n5. **Add 48-hour notification note** to cover sheet per Texas Health & Safety Code requirements\n6. **Clarify distribution vs. transmission designation** for existing overhead lines and confirm appropriate clearance standards apply"}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":11,"cache_creation_input_tokens":4294,"cache_read_input_tokens":89530,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":4294,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"output_tokens":1,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"a8920d43-e944-47ba-ad17-2e6340f56c7c","uuid":"af5b34f7-bb06-4e7b-9f1c-a49d12366f31"}
