{"level":30,"time":1776981770755,"pid":122,"hostname":"0067a724-a36","step":"review-runs","item":"13.md","index":5,"runIndex":"run-2","type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-haiku-4-5-20251001","id":"msg_01Fub7ZaYp8Juoo34boRvER1","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Now I'll compile my findings. Let me create a summary of findings and then provide the structured output:\n\n## RESEARCH SUMMARY — Transformer Pad Clearances and Location Requirements\n\n**Key Findings from Evidence Gathered:**\n\n### TRANSFORMER PADS IDENTIFIED:\n- **Pad 1 (West)**: Located on western edge near property line, approx. 19 feet from Building 1\n- **Pad 2 (North-Central)**: Located interior between Buildings 4 & 5, approx. 27-41 feet from nearest building, **0.6 feet from parking**\n- **Pad 3 (South-Central)**: Located interior between Buildings 6 & 7, approx. 21-31 feet from nearest buildings, 15.1 feet from parking\n\n### CLEARANCES VERIFICATION:\n✓ Building clearances (5 feet minimum): ALL PADS PASS (19+ feet measured)\n✗ Parking proximity (Pad 2): FAILS - only 0.6 feet from parking, requires bollards\n✗ Trees near pads: CLEAR VIOLATIONS - tree canopies shown overlapping or within pads on electrical plan; trees not identified with species\n\n### TRANSFORMER EASEMENTS:\n✗ No transformer easements shown on electrical plan (EL-13.35)\n\n### TRANSFORMER PAD SPECIFICATIONS:\n✗ No pad dimensions or AE Design-approved detail sheets referenced (EL-13.37)\n\n### BOLLARDS:\n✗ Transformer Pad 2 requires bollards (within 4 feet of parking) but none shown (EL-13.38)\n\n### TREES/VEGETATION:\n✗ Trees on electrical plan not cross-referenced to tree list; species and utility-compatibility unverifiable (EL-13.13)\n\n### UNDERGROUND UTILITIES:\n✗ Utility separations shown crossing but not dimensioned; minimum clearances unverifiable (EL-13.25)\n\n### PROPERTY LOCATION:\n✓ All pads within property boundaries, not in right-of-way\n\n### NOT FOUND / COULD NOT VERIFY:\n- Transformer easement widths/designations\n- Transformer pad detail sheet references or specifications\n- Bollard specifications (for Pad 2)\n- Tree species identification for trees shown near pads\n- Minimum separation distances for underground utilities\n- Hot-stick clearance area delineation\n- Access door orientation indicators\n- Cross-sections showing vertical clearances (may be N/A if no overhead structures)\n\n---\n\nNow I'll generate the structured output with only the fail and not-verifiable findings:"}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":10,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1571,"cache_read_input_tokens":79864,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":1571,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"output_tokens":1,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"2f2d0cbc-d0ea-481e-8f7b-51f5d8083c45","uuid":"4e9be429-5131-4b55-b042-92a93e0db842"}
